# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT -- do NOT add blanket ignores for generated mathematical data.
#
# Files under data/ (order-type representatives, exceptional profiles,
# survivor sets, certificates, SHA256SUMS) are generated, but they are the
# auditable content of this project and MUST be committed.
#
# The regenerable intermediate pickles below are ignored ONLY because they are
# large, machine-specific binary blobs that any user can rebuild in minutes
# with the documented commands (see docs/computational-method.md).  Their
# SHA-256 digests are recorded in data/hashes/SHA256SUMS instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pkl
!data/**/*.pkl

# Implementation B compiled binary (rebuild with the command in its README)
independent/implementation_b/reduction
